.Dd October 3, 2026
.Dt PWD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pwd
.Nd print the current working directory
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl LP
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the path of the current working directory.
.Pp
the options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl L
logical path, uses
.Ev PWD .
default option.
.It Fl P
physical path, avoids all symlinks.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cd 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
